Why Cloud Run is useful
No need to manage servers
Automatically scales up or down
Works well with FastAPI, Flask, Django, Node.js, etc.
Supports Docker containers
Gives your application a public URL
One-line meaning

Cloud Run = A serverless platform that runs your containerized application and makes it available on the internet.

For your FastAPI + Gemini AI chatbot projects, the simple architecture is:

FastAPI code → Docker → Cloud Build → Cloud Run → Live AI application 🚀

Cloud Run hosts the containerized FastAPI app, so the key deployment requirement is 
configuring the container to listen on Cloud Run’s PORT environment variable before it can serve traffic reliably.

